  "notes": "{監視|かんし} means surveillance, monitoring, or watching over something/someone.\n\nWRITING:\n- ⟦{監|かん}→監：noentry⟧: oversee, supervise\n- ⟦{視|し}→視：noentry⟧: look, watch\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {監視|かんし}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to monitor, to surveil\n- {監視|かんし}カメラ: surveillance camera\n- {監視|かんし}⟦{下|か}→下：noentry⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{置|お}く→置く：01092_oku⟧: to put under surveillance\n- {監視|かんし}⟦{体制|たいせい}→体制：04490_taisei⟧: monitoring system\n- {監視|かんし}⟦{員|いん}→員：noentry⟧: guard, watchman\n\nUSAGE:\n- Security: ⟦{防犯|ぼうはん}→防犯：08192_bouhan⟧{監視|かんし} (crime prevention monitoring)\n- Medical: ⟦{患者|かんじゃ}→患者：00170_kanja⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{監視|かんし} (patient monitoring)\n- IT: システム{監視|かんし} (system monitoring)",
